ment?o=`\n      <div class="principle-content">\n        <h2 style="color: ${n.titleColor}">${e.icon} ${e.name}</h2>\n\n        <div class="principle-section" style="background: ${n.bgColor}; border-color: ${n.borderColor};">\n          <h3 style="color: ${n.titleColor}">实验简介</h3>\n          <p style="color: ${n.textColor}">牛顿黏性定律实验是研究流体黏性的经典实验。通过在流体中移动平板，测量所需的力，可以得出流体的黏性系数，并验证牛顿黏性定律。</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class="principle-section" style="background: ${n.bgColor}; border-color: ${n.borderColor};">\n          <h3 style="color: ${n.titleColor}">牛顿黏性定律</h3>\n          <p style="color: ${n.textColor}">牛顿黏性定律指出：流体中的剪切应力 τ 与速度梯度 du/dy 成正比。</p>\n          <div class="formula-box">${e.formula}</div>\n          <p style="color: ${n.textColor}"><strong>其中：</strong></p>\n          <ul class="variable-list">\n            ${Object.entries(e.variables).map(([e,t])=>`<li><strong>${e}</strong>: ${t}</li>`).join("")}\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class="principle-section" style="background: ${n.bgColor}; border-color: ${n.borderColor};">\n          <h3 style="color: ${n.titleColor}">实验装置</h3>\n          <p style="color: ${n.textColor}">实验装置主要包括：</p>\n          <ol style="color: ${n.textColor}; padding-left: 20px;">\n            <li>两块平行平板，其间充满待测流体</li>\n            <li>上板固定，下板可移动</li>\n            <li>力传感器，用于测量移动下板所需的力</li>\n            <li>速度控制系统，控制下板的移动速度</li>\n          </ol>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class="principle-section" style="background: ${n.bgColor}; border-color: ${n.borderColor};">\n          <h3 style="color: ${n.titleColor}">关键概念</h3>\n          <p style="color: ${n.textColor}">• <strong>黏度</strong>：流体抵抗剪切变形的能力</p>\n          <p style="color: ${n.textColor}">• <strong>剪切应力</strong>：单位面积上的切向力</p>\n          <p style="color: ${n.textColor}">• <strong>速度梯度</strong>：速度在垂直于流动方向上的变化率</p>\n          <p style="color: ${n.textColor}">• <strong>牛顿流体</strong>：满足牛顿黏性定律的流体</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    `:"poiseuille"===E.currentExpe